## Changes made

The text in `data/` has been extracted from the licensed markdown corpus and
restructured into machine-readable records. Each record carries an `adaptation`
field recording how it was changed: `verbatim`, `abridged`, `restructured`, or
`original`. Per-book attribution is generated in ATTRIBUTION.md.

